    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I am preparing a technical brief for our CTO regarding our infrastructure preparations for the upcoming Q4 traffic surge. Can you provide a concise summary of the fundamental differences between vertical scaling and horizontal scaling in the context of AWS microservices? I need to explain this to a non-technical stakeholder, so please keep the technical jargon to a minimum while maintaining a professional tone.",
